// Copy to Local.xcconfig (gitignored) and fill in. Never commit the real file.
//
// DEVELOPMENT_TEAM: Xcode → Settings → Accounts → your Apple ID → Personal Team.
//   The 10-character ID is easiest to read after the first run, in the target's
//   Signing & Capabilities tab, or leave it empty and pick the team there once.
// BUNDLE_ID_PREFIX: reverse-DNS that is unique to you, e.g. com.yourname.
//   Must be globally unique on Apple's side; free teams can't reuse one taken by anyone else.
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =
BUNDLE_ID_PREFIX = com.example
